@RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress = http://localhost:5069

### 1) First call: CACHE MISS -> DATABASE QUERY -> CACHE SET
GET {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 2) Same call again: CACHE HIT (no SQL is executed)
GET {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### List (cache key products:all)
GET {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Not found -> 404 (nothing is cached)
GET {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products/9999
Accept: application/json

### Create -> invalidates products:all
POST {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Hub",
  "description": "7-in-1 hub with HDMI and card reader.",
  "price": 49.90
}

### Update -> invalidates product:1 and products:all
PUT {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard (v2)",
  "description": "Tenkeyless keyboard with red switches.",
  "price": 94.99
}

### Validation error -> 400
POST {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -1
}

### Delete -> invalidates product:4 and products:all
DELETE {{RedisDemoApplication_HostAddress}}/api/products/4
